---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import collage3 from "../assets/images/collages/3rd_collage.png";
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle="Urban Explorer">
    <article class="story">
        <div class="hoverable img-wrapper">
            <Image
                src={collage3}
                alt="Interiors and exteriors."
                class="flip-img"
            />
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <div class="scrolling">
                <p>
                    We have entered the doorway; we stand before a staircase
                    enshrouded almost completely in this sullen, almost
                    suffocating darkness. Here we shall pause for our
                    preliminary investigations… Ah, behold these ancient bronze
                    railings with their heavy flakes of coppery rust, and if we
                    move along here there is what appears to be… My God! The
                    paint has been scuffed away here and here in the shape of <i
                        >teeth marks</i
                    >, almost as if they have been made by wild animals or in
                    any case an inhuman, savage creature… What has happened in
                    the confines of this darkness, what secrets might it hold…
                    And if we look closer here you can see a dent, then another,
                    in the handles of the railings, that coupled with the
                    absolute stillness of the environment, seems to suggest a
                    supernatural violence… Can it be that the disturbed spirits
                    of the dead have pervaded this ancient hallway?
                </p>

                <p>
                    <i
                        >(A powerful flashlight suddenly flicks on and beams a
                        tunnel of white light onto the walls. We glimpse the
                        outlines of a staircase and a mailbox, most distinctly
                        ordinary-looking.)</i
                    >
                </p>

                <p>
                    Goddammit, (indistinct) out! <i
                        >(The light abruptly flicks out.)</i
                    >
                </p>

                <p>
                    Ahem! And so, as we come upon this most extraordinary
                    mystery in this most ancient and haunted house, we shall
                    presently begin to use our ghost sensor, which shall
                    hopefully aid us in discovering the auras of the
                    supernatural presences...
                </p>

                <p><i>(A long, angry goat’s bleat.)</i></p>

                <p>
                    My god, what is that sound? Did you hear it, did you hear
                    it? Can it be an animal spirit that has returned to haunt
                    the building in which its owner has tragically, tragically
                    perished?
                </p>

                <p>
                    <i
                        >(A faint, quick scuffling sound. A low, long, angry
                        bleat.)</i
                    >
                </p>

                <p>
                    <i>(Shakily, fearfully)</i> Can it be a stray after all? Yes (hastily),
                    yes, I daresay it must be, a stray that… Aaarrrgh!
                </p>

                <p>[Cuts to black.]</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    article.story {
        padding: 3rem var(--body-padding);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 5rem;
        height: 100vh;
        background-color: black;
        background-image: url(../assets/images/noise.svg);
        background-size: 10%;
    }

    .story .img-wrapper {
        max-width: 40rem;
    }

    .story .content {
        position: relative;
        max-width: 40rem;
        height: 100%;
        overflow-y: auto;
    }

    .story .scrolling {
        position: relative;
        top: 40vh;
        color: rgb(255, 255, 255);
    }
</style>
